cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Framefetch in research or publications, please cite it as below."
title: "Framefetch (帧取): self-hosted media workflow and AI video analysis"
abstract: >-
  Framefetch is an open-source, self-hosted workflow for authorized video
  parsing, local media import, screenplay processing and AI video analysis
  with Markdown and DOCX reports, built on FastAPI, Next.js, PostgreSQL,
  RabbitMQ and MinIO.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
authors:
